---
flowchart TD
    accTitle: Requested outreach drafts with manual Gmail sending
    accDescr: Telegram messages enter a saved queue. LangGraph answers questions and uses reading tools. Only an explicit email request and the owner's Start outreach action enter drafting. The workflow researches, qualifies, resolves recipients, checks contacts, writes and reviews drafts. Requested Gmail drafts are saved once and announced. The owner reviews, edits and sends in Gmail, outside the agent. App-only drafts retain review controls. SQLite or one Supabase PostgreSQL database holds saved state.
    telegram["Private Telegram<br/>Normal messages, files and decisions"] --> service["Shared service<br/>Saved queue and one worker"]
    dashboard["Owner dashboard<br/>Connections and controls"] --> service
    service --> chat["LANGGRAPH CONVERSATION<br/>4.3 instructions · 4.20 reasoning/tools<br/>Saved request + step + collected evidence"]
    chat -->|Read evidence| tools["Bounded read-only tools<br/>Files · browser · web / saved search · run status<br/>Multi-Agent evidence analysis when needed"]
    tools --> chat
    chat -->|Answer or clarify| answer["Reply in Telegram<br/>Continue the conversation"]
    chat -->|Email drafts requested| proposal["Show request + Start outreach button"]
    proposal -->|Owner starts it| files["Optional uploaded files<br/>Read text / local OCR · save cited evidence"]
    service -->|Dashboard or guided outreach| files
    files --> goal["LANGGRAPH<br/>Interpret the goal"]
    goal --> research["Research prospects + sources<br/>Files · notes · Brave · public browser<br/>4.20 Multi-Agent evidence analysis"]
    research --> qualification{"Qualified prospects?"}
    qualification -->|Yes| recipients["Resolve recipient addresses<br/>Published evidence or owner selection"]
    qualification -->|No| outcome["Save outcomes + relationship history"]
    recipients --> memory["Retrieve memory + Gmail history<br/>Apply contact rules"]
    memory -->|Allowed| strategy["Outreach strategy → write email"]
    memory -->|Blocked| outcome
    strategy --> review{"Review passes?"}
    review -->|Pass| destination{"Draft destination"}
    review -->|Revise within limit| strategy
    review -->|Limit exhausted| outcome
    destination -->|App only| approval["Review in app<br/>Edit, approve or reject"]
    approval -->|Edit| review
    approval -->|Record decision| outcome
    destination -->|Gmail requested| action["Recheck account, contact rules + duplicates<br/>Save Gmail draft · record confirmed result"]
    action --> outcome
    action --> notify["Notify owner: drafts are ready"]
    notify --> manual["YOU, IN GMAIL<br/>Review → edit → click Send"]
    store[("SQLite OR Supabase PostgreSQL<br/>Jobs, conversation, checkpoints and choices<br/>File text, events and action ledger")]
    tools -->|Save file / website evidence| index["Local embedding model<br/>Split passages · preserve sources"]
    index --> knowledge[("Saved knowledge<br/>Supabase pgvector + keyword indexes")]
    knowledge -. Relevant cited passages .-> tools
    originals[("Private originals<br/>Local files OR Supabase Storage")]
    originals -. Text extraction and OCR .-> files
    service -. Stop and continue same task .-> store
    approval -. Saved pause .-> store
    outcome -. Persist .-> store
    classDef decision fill:#fff6e6,stroke:#caa65d,color:#5b451b;
    classDef storage fill:#edf3fc,stroke:#8da6c7,color:#243b58;
    class qualification,review,destination decision;
    class store,outcome,knowledge,originals storage;
